{
  "uid": "obs-gateway",
  "title": "Gateway et expérience utilisateur",
  "description": "Ce que l'utilisateur subit réellement : latence par opération exposée, taux d'erreur, Web Vitals mesurés dans le navigateur, sessions actives. Les Web Vitals viennent de Faro et arrivent en JOURNAUX Loki (source=faro), non en métriques : les panneaux du bas sont donc en LogQL, et restent vides tant que le SDK Faro n'est pas branché côté frontend.",
  "tags": [
    "socle"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "gateway",
        "label": "Service exposé",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total, service_name)",
          "refId": "gateway"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Opérations exposées",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 32,
      "title": "Latence P95 par opération",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$gateway\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 500
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 33,
      "title": "Taux d'erreur par opération",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$gateway\", status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval])) or (sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$gateway\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0)) / sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 34,
      "title": "Navigateur (Faro)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 35,
      "title": "Web Vitals — P75 par mesure",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"measurement\" | type=\"web-vitals\" | __error__=\"\" | unwrap lcp [$__interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "LCP — plus grand rendu",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"measurement\" | type=\"web-vitals\" | __error__=\"\" | unwrap fcp [$__interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "FCP — premier rendu",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"measurement\" | type=\"web-vitals\" | __error__=\"\" | unwrap ttfb [$__interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "TTFB — premier octet",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"measurement\" | type=\"web-vitals\" | __error__=\"\" | unwrap inp [$__interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "INP — réactivité",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.75, {source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"measurement\" | type=\"web-vitals\" | __error__=\"\" | unwrap cls [$__interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "CLS — stabilité visuelle",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "LCP, FCP, TTFB, INP, CLS tels que le navigateur les mesure. Le P75 est la statistique de référence des Core Web Vitals — pas la moyenne.\n\nUne requête par mesure, et c'est obligatoire : le récepteur Faro d'Alloy écrit une ligne logfmt `kind=measurement type=web-vitals lcp=… fcp=…`, avec UN CHAMP PAR MESURE. Il n'existe ni champ `name` ni champ `value` — l'ancienne requête `unwrap value … by (name)` ne pouvait donc rendre qu'une série vide `{}` (constaté : 557 mesures agrégées sous une étiquette inexistante).\n\nCLS est sans unité, les quatre autres sont en millisecondes : l'axe est laissé en millisecondes, lire CLS sur sa propre échelle."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 36,
      "title": "Sessions actives",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (session_id) (count_over_time({source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | __error__=\"\" [$__interval])))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "sessions",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Sessions distinctes ayant émis au moins un événement sur l'intervalle.\n\nLe `count_over_time` intérieur n'est pas décoratif : LogQL n'accepte PAS d'agréger directement un intervalle de journaux (`count by (…) ({…} [5m])` → « syntax error: unexpected RANGE »). Sans lui, ce panneau renvoyait une erreur de syntaxe à chaque affichage et n'a jamais rien montré."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 37,
      "title": "Erreurs côté navigateur",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "id": 38,
      "title": "Exceptions JavaScript",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{source=\"faro\"} | logfmt | kind=\"exception\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "description": "Les traces Faro rejoignent le collector : une exception du navigateur porte le même trace_id que l'appel serveur qui l'a provoquée."
    }
  ]
}
